  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kodeni and Pa Solar Power Plants, through Tetra Tech, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant to Societe de Production d&apos;Energie Solaire de Kodeni SAS will fund a feasibility study (&quot;Study&quot;) to determine the viability of two 17 megawatt solar photovoltaic projects near the villages of Pa and Kodeni in southwest Burkina Faso. These represent some of the first solar plants in Burkina Faso and are among the first competitively bid independent power producer projects in Burkina Faso. The Study will help to increase the market opportunities for U.S. companies and support Burkina Faso to produce indigenous, affordable energy to meet its existing and growing energy demand.</narrative>
  </description>
